  "explanation": "Three answers to one fork, judged by whether the list exists before the stage writes the turn you read. [Hook only](#option-b) produces it a turn late; [a separate lane](#option-a) and [the stage writing as it goes](#option-c) both make it in time, and the second does it without a lane. Leaves out the wording register, which is a separate question either way.",
